  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Finely chop brown onion and garlic.\n• Zest lemon to get a good pinch, then slice into wedges.\n• In a large frying pan, heat the butter with a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook onion, stirring, until tender, 4-5 minutes.\n• Add garlic and lemon zest. Cook until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-671b2db58ad42be8e34602d5-daf638ba.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To the frying pan, add, risotto-style rice, the water and vegetable stock pot (see ingredients). Bring to the boil, then remove from heat.\n• Transfer risotto to a baking dish. Cover tightly with foil.\n• Bake until liquid is absorbed and rice is 'al dente', 24-28 minutes. TIP: 'Al dente' rice is cooked through but still slightly firm in the centre.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-671b2db58ad42be8e34602d5-89bfbc81.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, halve snacking tomatoes.\n• Pick rosemary leaves. TIP: Run your fingers down the rosemary stalk to remove the leaves easily.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-671b2db58ad42be8e34602d5-95daa118.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Place snacking tomatoes and rosemary on a lined oven tray.\n• Drizzle with the balsamic vinegar and olive oil. Season with salt and pepper. Toss to coat.\n• Roast until blistered, 15-20 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-671b2db58ad42be8e34602d5-ec5c41ce.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When the risotto is ready, stir through basil pesto, Parmesan cheese and a squeeze of lemon juice. Season to taste.\n• Gently fold in roasted tomatoes and baby spinach leaves. TIP: Stir through a splash of water to loosen the risotto, if needed.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-671b2db58ad42be8e34602d5-125ef29e.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide baked cherry tomato and pesto risotto between bowls.\n• Sprinkle with pine nuts.\n• Serve with any remaining lemon wedges. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-671b2db58ad42be8e34602d5-a52d1ef8.jpeg"
    }
  ]
